# Coverage Report

Distinguishes genuinely isolated services from those whose outbound edges could not be resolved.

| Service | Classification | Outbound edges | Detected | Resolved | Unresolved | External |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| api | isolated | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| consumer | connected | 1 | 4 | 1 | 1 | 2 |

`isolated` means no outbound edges and no detected call sites either: a genuine leaf, not a gap in enola's resolution.
